* TEXTFELD - enthält den zu bearbeitenden Text                         *
*            text that is to be checked                                *
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
FORM dta_text_aufbereiten USING textfeld.

  IF flg_no_replace EQ space.
    CALL FUNCTION 'SCP_REPLACE_STRANGE_CHARS'
      EXPORTING
