*     we have to archive
        data ld_documentclass like TOADV-DOC_TYPE value 'PDF'. " 1683912
        CALL FUNCTION 'ARCHIV_CREATE_OUTGOINGDOCUMENT'
        EXPORTING
          arc_p                    = arc_params
