      ENDIF.
* end section reworked by note 2228804
    ENDIF.
  ELSE.
* SAPscript Formular starten
    CALL FUNCTION 'START_FORM'
      EXPORTING
        archive_index = toa_dara
        form          = hlp_formular
        language      = hlp_sprache.

    IF hlp_xhrfo EQ space.

